{'symbol': 'HCA', 'date': '2022-08-08 16:30:00', 'title': 'HCA HEALTHCARE TO DONATE UP TO $400,000 TO KENTUCKY FLOOD RELIEF EFFORTS', 'text': "NASHVILLE, TENN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HCA HEALTHCARE, INC. (NYSE: HCA), ONE OF THE NATION'S LEADING HEALTHCARE PROVIDERS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT WILL CONTRIBUTE UP TO $400,000 IN FUNDING, COLLEAGUE MATCHING AND IN-KIND DONATIONS TO SUPPORT ORGANIZATIONS PROVIDING RELIEF SERVICES TO EASTERN KENTUCKY COMMUNITIES STRUCK BY HISTORIC FLOODING. HCA HEALTHCARE WILL CONTRIBUTE TO THE FOLLOWING ORGANIZATIONS: $100,000 TO THE AMERICAN RED CROSS $100,000 TO THE TEAM EASTERN KENTUCKY FLOOD RELIEF FUND UP TO"}